# HelpHub design system

Use `@helphub/design-system` as the only visual source of truth.

## Tokens

- CSS variables in `src/styles/tokens.css` own every brand hex.
- Components and new UI must use semantic utilities: `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `bg-card`, `bg-primary`, `text-primary-foreground`, `bg-muted`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, `ring-ring`, `bg-sidebar`, `bg-destructive`.
- Never hardcode hex (`#2563eb`, `#0f172a`, …) in React/TSX/CSS outside `tokens.css`.
- Never invent alternate brand blues, slates, or reds.

## Locked hex roles

- Neutrals: `#ffffff` white; `#f8fafc` slate-50; `#f1f5f9` slate-100; `#e2e8f0` slate-200; `#94a3b8` slate-400; `#64748b` slate-500; `#1e293b` slate-800; `#0f172a` slate-900; `#020617` slate-950
- Blues: `#bfdbfe` `#93c5fd` `#60a5fa` `#3b82f6` `#2563eb` `#1d4ed8` `#1e40af` `#1e3a8a`
- Destructive: `#ef4444` (light), `#7f1d1d` (dark)

## Components

Prefer exported primitives (`Button`, `Input`, `Card`, `Badge`, `Text`, `Heading`, `ThemeProvider`) before creating new ones. New components must stay token-only and follow `cn` + CVA.

## Theme

Wrap apps in `ThemeProvider`. Dark mode is the `.dark` class on `html`. Persist with `helphub-theme`.

## Import path

```ts
import { Button, ThemeProvider } from "@helphub/design-system";
import "@helphub/design-system/styles.css";
```

Typography default is Inter via `--font-sans` (swappable).
